G-XXXXXX  open  runs: 3 of 3 used
stop: budget used, by run <id> at <time>
waits: owner
owner may:
  hyp land G-XXXXXX
grill may:
  hyp place G-XXXXXX line-1/<example>
probe-writer may:
  (none)
runner may:
  (none)
outputs: each cell shows at most 60 characters of the output's first line; all its bytes are in .tree/outputs/<hash>
  row <hash>
    line-1/a  failed  exit 0  <hash>  3 bytes: bad
  row <hash>
    line-1/a  failed  exit 0  <hash>  2 bytes: x1
  row <hash>
    line-1/a  failed  exit 0  <hash>  2 bytes: x2
  row <hash>
    line-1/a  failed  exit 0  <hash>  2 bytes: x3
